
<center>
    

    <table summary="" width="720" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
    border="0">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <h4>網路上的茄科資源(Solanaceae Resources on the Web)</h4>

          <table summary="">
            <tr>
              <td width="20">&nbsp;</td>

              <td>
                <strong>茄科系統分類學、描述、圖像與種原(Solanaceae Systematics, Descriptions, Images, Germplasms)</strong>

		<dl>
		  <dt><br /><a href="http://www.ru.nl/bgard/">奈梅亨拉德堡德大學實驗花園與基因庫(Experimental Garden and Genebank of the Radboud University of Nijmegen)</a></dl>
		<dd>奈梅亨拉德堡德大學實驗花園與基因庫特別關注茄科，並維護全球最廣泛的非塊莖類茄科植物非原生境植物保藏。(The Experimental Garden and Genebank of the Radboud University of Nijmegen pays special attention to the family of Solanaceae and maintains the most extensive ex situ plant collection of non-tuberous Solanaceae species in the world.)  </dd>

		<dl>
		  <dt><br /><a href="http://www.ecpgr.cgiar.org/">歐洲植物遺傳資源合作計畫(European Cooperative Programme for Plant Genetic Resources)</a></dl>

		<dd>歐洲植物遺傳資源合作計畫 (ECPGR) 是大多數歐洲國家之間的合作計畫，旨在確保歐洲植物遺傳資源的長期保護並促進其利用率提升 (<a href="http://www.ecpgr.cgiar.org/networks/vegetables/solanaceae.html">茄科(Solanaceae)</a>, <a href="http://www.ecpgr.cgiar.org/networks/sugar_starch_fibre_crops/potato.html">馬鈴薯(Potato)</a>)。(The European Cooperative Programme for Plant Genetic Resources (ECPGR) is a collaborative programme among most European countries aimed at ensuring the long-term conservation and facilitating the increased utilization of plant genetic resources in Europe (<a href="http://www.ecpgr.cgiar.org/networks/vegetables/solanaceae.html">Solanaceae</a>, <a href="http://www.ecpgr.cgiar.org/networks/sugar_starch_fibre_crops/potato.html">Potato</a>))</dd>

                <dl>

                  <dt><br /><a href="http://solcap.msu.edu" target="_new" >SolCAP</a></dt>
                  <dd>美國農業部 (USDA) 資助的茄科協調農業計畫 (SolCAP) 官方網站，該計畫對番茄和馬鈴薯品系的大型樣本群進行表型鑑定和基因型分析。結果也將發布於 SGN 上。(The official website of the USDA sponsored Solanaceae Coordinated Agricultural Project (SolCAP), which will phenotype and genotype large panels of tomato and potato accessions. Results will also be made available on SGN.)</dd>
                  <dt><a href=
                  "http://www.nhm.ac.uk/research-curation/projects/solanaceaesource/" target="_new">Solanum
                  Source</a></dt>

                  <dd>Solanum PBI 計畫的官方網站，包含物種描述、植物標本館標本資料、名稱及其發表出處的命名法資料，以及有關該科成員的科學論文參考書目。(The official website of the Solanum PBI project, containing species descriptions, specimen data from herbaria, nomenclatural data about names and their places of publication, and a bibliography of scientific articles about members of the family.)</dd>


                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://www.bgard.science.ru.nl/" target="_new">荷蘭奈梅亨實驗花園與基因庫(Nijmegen Experimental Garden and Genebank in the Netherlands)</a></dt>

                  <dd>擁有茄科植物主要保藏之一的植物園。(A botanical garden with one of the major collections of Solanaceae plants.)</dd>
    

                </dl>

                <strong>番茄資源(Tomato Resources)</strong>

    

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href="http://tomatoma.nbrp.jp/index.jsp" target="_new"> TOMATOMA 資料庫(TOMATOMA Database)</a> 
    </dt>
    <dd>日本 MicroTom 背景的 EMS 和中子突變體資料庫。(A database of EMS and Neutron mutants in the MicroTom background in Japan.)</dd>

    <dt><a href="http://www.agrobios.it/tilling" target="_new"> LycoTILL</a></dt>
<dd>LycoTILL 是一個互動式且不斷發展的資料庫，允許線上搜尋透過 EMS 誘變實驗生成的番茄（品種 Red Setter）突變體集合的圖像和表型資料。Red Setter 突變體族群是為 TILLING 應用而開發的，但也可以用於正向遺傳學研究。(LycoTILL is an interactive and evolving database which allows search on-line of images and phenotype data of the tomato (cv /Red Setter/) mutant collection generated with EMS mutagenesis experiments. The Red Setter mutant population was developed for TILLING applications but can also be used for forward genetic studies.)</dd>

                  <dt><a href="http://phn.huji.ac.il/RTQ/" target="_new" >Phenom Networks</a></dt>
                  <dd>由 Dani Zamir 和 Yaniv Semel 開發的 Phenom Network 引擎代表複雜性狀的知識，擁有番茄滲入系 (IL)、大麥和玫瑰性狀，很快將新增更多生物。(The Phenom Network engine by Dani Zamir and Yaniv Semel represents knowledge of complex traits and has tomato ILs, barley and rose traits with more organisms being added soon.)</dd>

                  <dt><a href="http://www-plb.ucdavis.edu/labs/maloof/tomatosnp/" target="_new" >番茄 SNP 資料庫(Tomato SNP database)</a></dt>
                  <dd>由加州大學戴維斯分校的 Jose Jimenez 和 Julin Maloof 建立的番茄 SNP 網站。(A tomato SNP website by Jose Jimenez and Julin Maloof at UC Davis)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://www.kazusa.or.jp/jsol/microtom/index.html" target="_new">MiBASE</a>, Kazusa Microtom 網站(the Kazusa Microtom Site)</dt>

                  <dd>來自 Microtom 的 EST 和 unigene 資料集，包含 GO 註釋與代謝途徑檢視器。(EST and unigene dataset from Microtom, including GO annotations and Pathway Viewer.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href="http://www.pgb.kazusa.or.jp/kaftom/" target="_new" >KaFTom</a></dt>
                  <dd>Kazusa Micro-Tom 全長 cDNA 網站(The Kazusa Micro-Tom full-length cDNA Site)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href="http://tgc.ifas.ufl.edu" target="_new">番茄遺傳合作組織(The Tomato Genetics Cooperative)</a></dt>

                  <dd>番茄遺傳合作組織首頁，可線上閱讀出版物。(Homepage of the Tomato Genetics Cooperative with access to publications on-line.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href="http://tgrc.ucdavis.edu" target="_new" >番茄遺傳資源中心 (TGRC)(Tomato Genetic Resource Center (TGRC))</a></dt>

                  <dd>茄科種原的大型集合，特別著重於番茄。(Large collection of Solanaceae germplasms, with a special focus on tomato.)</dd>

                  
                  <dt><br /><a href="http://ted.bti.cornell.edu/" target="_new" >番茄表現資料庫 (TED)(Tomato Expression Database (TED))</a></dt>

                  <dd>專門收錄番茄微陣列 (microarray) 的網站。(Site dedicated to tomato microarrays.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://www.tomato.org/" target="_new">加州番茄委員會(California Tomato Commission)</a></dt>

                  <dd>加州番茄種植者協會網站。包含營養資訊與食譜。(The website of the California Tomato Grower's Association. Contains nutritional information and recipes.)</dd>


                  <dt><br /><a href="http://www.ars.usda.gov/Main/site_main.htm?modecode=19-10-05-00" target="_new" >USDA ARS 生物資訊學首頁(USDA ARS Bioinformatics Homepage)</a></dt>

                  <dd>位於紐約州日內瓦的 USDA 生物資訊學部門網站。(The website of the USDA bioinformatics unit in Geneva, NY)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://solcap.msu.edu/" target="_new" >
                  SolCAP 計畫(SolCAP project)</a></dt>
                  <dd>茄科協同農業計畫(The Solanaceae Coordinated Agriculture Project)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "https://www.eu-sol.wur.nl" target="_new" >EU-SOL 番茄核心集合表型資料庫(EU-SOL Tomato Core Collection Phenotype Database)</a></dt>
                  <dd>由歐盟第六框架計畫資助的 <a href="http://www.eu-sol.net">EU-SOL</a> 計畫提供的番茄核心集合表型資料庫。(The Tomato Core Collection Phenotype Database by the <a href="http://www.eu-sol.net">EU-SOL</a> Project funded by the 6th framework program of the European Union.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://tomato.nbrp.jp/indexEn.html" target="_new" >番茄國家生物資源計畫(Tomato National BioResource Project)</a></dt>
                  <dd>國家生物資源計畫 (NBRP) 是一項國家級計畫，旨在為生命科學研究收集、保存和提供生物資源。(The National BioResource Project (NBRP) is a national project that aims to collect, preserve, and provide bioresources for life sciences research.)</dd>

                </dl>
                <strong>番茄 - 園藝與傳家品種(Tomatoes - gardening and heirloom varieties)</strong>
                <dl>
                <dt><a href="http://www.tomatogardeningguru.com/" target="_new" >www.tomatogardeningguru.com</a></dt>
                <dd>關於有機種植番茄的網站(A website about growing tomatoes organically)</dd>
                <dt><a href="http://www.tomatofest.com" target="_new" >TomatoFest.com</a></dt>
                <dd>傳家番茄節(Heirloom tomato fest)</dd>
                </dl>
                <strong>番茄 - 輕鬆幽默(Tomatoes - the lighter side)</strong>
                <dl>
                <dt><a href="http://tomatoesareevil.com" target="_new">TomatoesAreEvil.com</a></dt>
                <dd>番茄討厭者的網站（絕對不是我們！）(A website by tomato haters (that's definitely not us!))</dd>
                <dt><br /><a href="http://killertomatoes.com" target="_new" >Killertomatoes.com</a></dt>
                
                <strong>馬鈴薯資源(Potato Resources)</strong>

		<dl>
		  <dt><a href="http://www.public.iastate.edu/~djh/">馬鈴薯韌皮部生物學計畫(Potato Phloem Biology Project)</a>
		 </dt>
		  <dd>由 NSF 資助的研究塊莖形成誘導過程中涉及的訊息傳遞網絡的計畫。(An NSF funded project to study signaling networks that are involved in the induction of tuber formation.)</dd>
</dl>


                <dl>

                  <dt><a href="http://www.potatodiseases.org/" target="_new" >PotatoDiseases.org</a></dt>
                  <dd>密西根大學描述馬鈴薯病害的網站。(A site describing diseases of potato from the University of Michigan.)</dd>

                  <dt><a href="http://www.cpgp.ca" target="_new" >加拿大馬鈴薯基因體計畫(Canadian Potato Genome Project)</a></dt>
                  <dd>加拿大馬鈴薯基因體計畫 (CPGP) 於 2002 年啟動，旨在開發馬鈴薯基因發現資源，供加拿大研究人員及其合作夥伴使用。(The Canadian Potato Genome Project (CPGP) was launched in 2002 to develop resources in gene discovery in potatoes, for use by Canadian researchers and their partners.)</dd>
    
                  <dt><a href="https://gabi.rzpd.de/PoMaMo.html" target="_new" >PoMaMo 資料庫(PoMaMo Database)</a></dt>

                  <dd>來自德國科隆馬克斯普朗克植物育種研究所的馬鈴薯基因體資料，包括 SNP 資料、圖譜、標記序列、參考文獻等。(Potato genome data from the Max-Planck Institute for Plant Breeding Research, Cologne, Germany, which includes SNP data, maps, marker sequences, references and more.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href="http://www.cipotato.org" target="_new" >國際馬鈴薯中心 (Centro Internacional de la Papa)</a> (秘魯國際馬鈴薯中心(International Potato Center, Peru))</dt>

                  <dd>位於秘魯利馬的國際馬鈴薯中心，擁有馬鈴薯專用資料庫和資源，例如 <a href=
                  "http://grcc.cip.cgiar.org/genebank/" target="_new">CIP 馬鈴薯基因庫(CIP Potato Genebank)</a> 和 <a href=
                  "http://wpa.riu.cip.cgiar.org/index.php" target="_new" >世界馬鈴薯地圖集(World Potato Atlas)</a>(The International Potato Center in Lima, Peru, with potato specific databases and resources, such as the <a href="http://grcc.cip.cgiar.org/genebank/" target="_new">CIP Potato Genebank</a> and the <a href="http://wpa.riu.cip.cgiar.org/index.php" target="_new" >World Potato Atlas</a>)</dd>

                  <dd>探討馬鈴薯與生物技術議題的網站。(A site for potato and biotechnology issues.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href="http://gilb.cip.cgiar.org/" target="_new" >晚疫病全球倡議 (GILB)(Global Initiative for Late Blight (GILB))</a></dt>

                  <dd>晚疫病研究合作組織。(A collaboration for Late Blight research.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://www.potgenebank.org/" target="_new" >馬鈴薯跨基因庫(Intergenebank for Potato)</a></dt>

                  <dd>包含來自世界各地不同基因庫的品系資料的資料庫，包括 SSR 資料庫。(A database containing accession data from different genebanks around the world, including an SSR database.)</dd>

                  <!-- dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://www.potatogenome.org/nsf4/" target="_new" >PotatoGenome.org</a></dt  DEFUNCT?? -->

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://www.europotato.org/" target="_new" >歐洲栽培馬鈴薯資料庫(European Cultivated Potato Database)</a></dt>

                   

                  <dd>NSF 馬鈴薯基因體計畫官方網站。(The official website of the NSF potato genome project.)</dd>
                </dl>

                <strong>辣椒資源(Pepper Resources)</strong>

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href=
                  "http://plant.pdrc.re.kr/ks200201/pepper.html" target="_new" >KRIBB 辣椒資源(KRIBB Pepper Resources)</a></dt>

                  <dd>KRIBB 的辣椒 EST 資料庫(A pepper EST database at KRIBB)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://www.cnph.embrapa.br/capsicum/" target="_new" >Embrapa 辣椒網站(Embrapa Capsicum site)</a></dt>

                  <dd>巴西專門探討辣椒的網站(A site dedicated to Pepper in Brazil)</dd>
                </dl>

                <strong>矮牽牛資源(Petunia Resources)</strong>

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href=
                  "http://www.petuniaplatform.net" target="_new" >Petuniaplatform.net</a></dt>

                  <dd>專門探討矮牽牛的網站，包含聯絡人、技術、參考書目和其他資訊。(A website dedicated to Petunia, with contacts, techniques, bibliography and other information.)</dd>
                </dl>

                <strong>茄子資源(Eggplant Resources)</strong>

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href=
                  "http://www.bgard.science.ru.nl/WWW-IPGRI/eggplant.htm" target="_new" >茄子資料庫(Eggplant Database)</a>
                   </dt>
</dl>

<br />
		<strong><i>歐白英 (Solanum dulcamara)</i> 資源(Solanum dulcamara Resources)</strong>

		<dl><dt><a href="http://www.ru.nl/bsweet/">B'sweet 網站(The B'sweet website)</a></dt>
		  <dd><i>歐白英 (Solanum dulcamara)</i> 是適應和生態學研究的新模型。另請參閱 <a href="http://www.ru.nl/ecogen/">Nicole van Ham 的網站(Nicole van Ham's website)</a>(Solanum dulcamara is a new research model for adaptation and ecology. See also <a href="http://www.ru.nl/ecogen/">Nicole van Ham's website</a>)</dd> 

		  </dl>

                <strong>咖啡資源(Coffee Resources)</strong>

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href="http://www.coffeedna.net/" target="_new" >CoffeeDNA - 義大利咖啡基因體學網站(CoffeeDNA - A site for Coffee Genomics in Italy)</a></dt>

                  <dd>關於咖啡與咖啡基因體學的網站。某些功能需要登入。(A site about coffee and coffee genomics. Login required for certain functions.)</dd>
                </dl>

                <strong>種原資源(Germplasm Resources)</strong>

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href="http://tgrc.ucdavis.edu" target="_new" >番茄遺傳資源中心 (TGRC)(Tomato Genetic Resource Center (TGRC))</a></dt>

                  <dd>茄科種原的大型集合，特別著重於番茄。(Large collection of Solanaceae germplasms, with a special focus on tomato.)</dd>

                  <dt><br /><a href="http://www.ars-grin.gov/npgs/" target="_new" >國家種原系統 (GRIN)(GRIN, The National Germplasm System)</a></dt>

                  <dd>大型種原資料庫，整合了美國的許多種原中心。(Large database of germplasm, integrating many germplasm centers in the United States.)</dd>
                </dl>

                <strong>真菊類植物資源(Euasterid Resources)</strong>

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href="http://www.antirrhinum.net" target="_new" >Antirrhinum.net</a></dt>
                  <dd>金魚草屬的 DragonDB 資料庫(The DragonDB database for Antirrhinum)</dd>
                </dl>

                <strong>其他序列資源(Other Sequence Resources)</strong>

                <dl>
                  <dt><a href="http://www.genome.arizona.edu/" target="_new" >亞利桑那基因體倡議 (AGI)(The Arizona Genome Initiative (AGI))</a></dt>

                  <dd>AGI 是為許多茄科物種（如馬鈴薯）<a href=
                  "http://www.genome.arizona.edu/orders/" target="_new" >訂購(order)</a>許多 EST 和 BAC 選殖株的地方。請注意，番茄的 BAC 和 EST <a href=
                  "http://ted.bti.cornell.edu/order/" target="_new" >訂單(orders)</a>由 <a href=
                  "http://bti.cornell.edu/" target="_new" >Boyce Thompson 研究所(Boyce Thompson Institute)</a>處理。(The AGI is the place to <a href="http://www.genome.arizona.edu/orders/" target="_new" >order</a> many of the ESTs and BAC clones for many Solanaceae species such as potato. Please note that BAC and EST <a href="http://ted.bti.cornell.edu/order/" target="_new" >orders</a> for tomato are handled by the <a href="http://bti.cornell.edu/" target="_new" >Boyce Thompson Institute</a>.)</dd>

                  <!-- LINK DEAD 11/2008 dt><br /><a href="http://www.tigr.org/tigr-scripts/tgi/T_index.cgi?species=tomato">The
                  Institute for Genomic Research\'s (TIGR) Tomato
                  Gene Index</a></dt>

                  <dd>The TIGR gene index for tomato.</dd -->

                  <!--  LINK DEAD 11/2008 dt><br /><a href=
                  "http://grain.jouy.inra.fr/webace/webace?db=solgenes">
                  SolGenes</a></dt>

                  <dd>The original SolGenes database. Still a
                  treasure of information.</dd -->
                </dl>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <h4><a name="related" id="related"></a>相關網站連結(Links to related websites)</h4>

          <ul>
            <li><a href="http://seedplants.org" target="_new" >Seedplants.org</a>，關於種子植物描述和分類學的網站。(Seedplants.org, a site about seed plant descriptions and taxonomy.)</li>
            <li><a href=
            "http://internt.nhm.ac.uk/jdsml/nature-online/seeds-of-trade/" target="_new" >貿易的種子(Seeds of Trade)</a> - Henry Hobhouse 和 Sandra Knapp 撰寫的關於植物栽培歷史的虛擬書籍。(Seeds of Trade - a virtual book by Henry Hobhouse and Sandra Knapp about the history of plant cultivation.)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.arabidopsis.org" target="_new" >TAIR</a> - 阿拉伯芥資訊資源(The Arabidopsis Information Resource)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.medicago.org" target="_new" >苜蓿 (Medicago truncatula)</a> - 豆科植物研究模型(a model for legume research)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.gramene.org" target="_new" >Gramene</a> - 禾本科植物比較圖譜資源(a comparative mapping resource for the grasses)</li>

            <li><a href="http://cggc.agtec.uga.edu" target="_new" >禾本科比較基因體學中心(Comparative Grass Genomics Center)</a> - 禾本科植物比較資源，專注於 <em>高粱 (Sorghum)</em>。(a comparative resource for grasses, focusing on Sorghum.)</li>

            <li><a href=
            "http://www.shigen.nig.ac.jp/rice/oryzabase/top/top.jsp" target="_new" >OryzaBase</a> - 綜合水稻科學資料庫(Integrated Rice Science Database)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.maizeGDB.org" target="_new" >MaizeGDB</a> - 玉米遺傳學與基因體學資料庫(Maize Genetics and Genomics Database)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.plantGDB.org" target="_new" >PlantGDB</a> - 植物基因體資料庫(Plant Genome DataBase)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/" target="_new" >NCBI</a> - 美國國家生物技術資訊中心(National Center for Biotechnology Information)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.biocyc.org" target="_new" >BioCyc</a>,
            <a href="http://www.metacyc.org" target="_new" >MetaCyc</a> 和
            <a href=
            "http://www.arabidopsis.org/biocyc/index.jsp" target="_new" >AraCyc</a> - 策劃生物化學代謝途徑的集合。(Collections of curated biochemical pathways.)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.genome.ad.jp/kegg/" target="_new" >KEGG</a> - 京都基因與基因體百科全書(Kyoto Encyclopedia of Genes and Genomes.)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.biomoby.org" target="_new" >BioMoby 計畫(The BioMoby Project)</a> - 資料庫互通性計畫(the database interoperability project)</li>

            <li><a href="http://www.genomics.cornell.edu" target="_new" >康乃爾基因體學倡議(Cornell Genomics Initiative)</a></li>

            <li><a href="http://biocurator.org" target="_new" >Biocurator.org</a> - 生物策劃官方網站(the official site for biocuration.)</li>
          </ul><br />
          <br />
          <br />
          <br />
          <br />
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    
  </center>
